# West/CMake output. Samples are built in place (west build -b native_sim/...),
# so the build tree lands inside the repository. This must be excluded as a
# directory rather than by pattern: the !*.h rule below would otherwise
# re-include every generated header underneath it.
build/

# this overrides the rule against tracking header files from pico-de-gallo root .gitignore. We need to track headers for this
# subproject since they are for source files and not autogenerated FFI headers
!*.h